    [Refactor] Remove legacy DSA-CP implementation (#19493)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    Remove legacy TP-based DSA-CP code, configuration and dedicated tests.
    Preserve PCP/DCP implementations.
    
    Merged migrations:
    
    - Nightly: #17681.
    - Weekly: #19643.
    - Documentation: #19491.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    Yes. Remove `enable_dsa_cp`; use `--prefill-context-parallel-size`
    instead.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    Python compilation and removed-symbol reference checks. UT/E2E execution
    pending CI.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/544f182d9f0c9bfe8bd7645525951d5e3692a542
    
    ---------
    
    Signed-off-by: leolee <yihao.li@huawei.com>

